5. DEVELOPMENT PRINCIPLE

DO NOT build the entire system in one uncontrolled operation.

Build incrementally.

After every major phase:

1. Compile/build.
2. Run tests.
3. Check errors.
4. Check responsive behavior.
5. Check authentication.
6. Check permissions.
7. Check database migrations.
8. Review against the relevant documentation.
9. Fix issues.
10. Only then continue.

